    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n***ON VIEW BY PRIVATE APPOINTMENT***\n\n**Contact us today at www.kylemore-killiney.ie to arrange a viewing***\n\nKylemore House set within the grounds of Kylemore Wood has been beautifully restored and renovated into six stunning apartments. The home has been transformed into a mix of five 2-bedroom apartments and one 3- bedroom apartment all newly decorated with modern internal finishes. The character of the house retains many of the original features to include high ceilings, sash windows, coving and is flooded with natural light. There is a lift in the main entrance foyer and apartments are spacious with flooring and appliances included and are ready for immediate occupation. Situated off Church Road with vehicular access from Watson Road, it is the perfect location to put down roots in South Dublin!\n\nThe development is very well situated with easy access to the M50 motorway and is close to shops, schools and public transport.\n\nThe convenience of this location cannot be overstated situated between the idyllic village of Killiney with its scenic walks and Dalkey with its extensive choice of pubs, restaurants, and shops. There is also a local bus service which runs to Dalkey and Dun Laoghaire, and Killiney DART station is close by. Access to the M50 is approx. a 10-minute drive away.\n\nVirtual staging images are used for illustrative purposes"
      },
